          {
            "line_number": 135,
            "line": "Third quarter 2026 operating income decreased $15 million, or 3 percent, primarily due to a lower operating margin rate, partially offset by higher sales. Third quarter 2026 operating margin rate of 15.8 percent reflects strong program performance on marine systems and restricted airborne radar programs. Operating margin rate decreased from 16.7 percent in the third quarter of 2025 due, in part, to a prior year $68 million favorable EAC adjustment in the restricted advanced microelectronics portfolio."
