        "line_number": 25,
        "line": "FALLS CHURCH, Va. – October 20, 2026 – Northrop Grumman Corporation (NYSE: NOC) reported third quarter 2026 sales increased 7 percent to $11.1 billion, as compared with $10.4 billion in the third quarter of 2025. Third quarter sales reflect continued strong demand for our global capabilities. Third quarter 2026 net earnings totaled $1.1 billion, or $7.89 per diluted share, as compared with $1.1 billion, or $7.67 per diluted share, in the third quarter of 2025.",
